<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="width: 500px;"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Statement&nbsp;I:</strong></td><td>RNA being unstable, it mutates at a faster rate</td></tr><tr><td><strong><span style="white-space:nowrap;">Statement II:</span></strong></td><td>RNA can directly code for synthesis of proteins hence can easily express the characters.</td></tr></tbody></table>
